MarshalJSON for alertRule to emit kind-specific fields.

Now write the code.

Handlers:

```go
const alertRulesPath = "/api/v1/alert-rules"
const alertsPath = "/api/v1/alerts"
```

In Handler():

```go
mux.HandleFunc(alertRulesPath, func(w, r) {
    if r.Method != http.MethodGet {
        w.Header().Set("Allow", http.MethodGet)
        writeAPIError(w, "method_not_allowed", http.StatusMethodNotAllowed)
